            "@type": "Answer",
            text: "One year. Every THERUN listing checked on Amazon in November 2026 gave one year in its product information, and one said “1 Year Manufacturer”. None separated frame, motor and parts cover, so plan on one year for everything and keep your order confirmation.",
          },
