          <a href="#therun-16-incline-treadmill-400lb"><img src="https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41HAdIkHr8L._SL500_.jpg" alt="THERUN 16% Incline Folding Treadmill (400 lb)" width="500" height="500" decoding="async" /></a>
          <a href="#therun-12-auto-incline-treadmill"><img src="https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41TP5tk6XaL._SL500_.jpg" alt="THERUN 12% Auto Incline Treadmill (TR06)" width="500" height="500" decoding="async" /></a>
        </div>
        <figcaption>THERUN 20% Auto Incline Treadmill · THERUN 16% Incline Folding Treadmill (400 lb) · THERUN 12% Auto Incline Treadmill (TR06)</figcaption>
      </figure>

      <div class="ed-body prose prose-lg">
        <p class="ed-lead">
          THERUN is one of the brands that appears again and again when you search Amazon for a cheap incline
