          sets out the THERUN machines that were on sale on 21 November 2026, what each listing claims, where the
          listings disagree with themselves, who sells them, what the warranty is, and which THERUN, if any, is
          worth buying. Nothing here was tested hands-on; it is built from the Amazon listings, their product
          information and independent coverage.
        </p>

